Subject: [PATCH 05/15] POC: force frame change after WS_CLIPCHILDREN - style
 bits do not apply without it

The user's rig observation nailed the diagnosis: after -nokeepaspect,
punch-through frames became full-width-stretched (MAME's own blit)
while the overlay's frames stayed aspect-correct - two renders visibly
competing. SetWindowLongPtr alone does not activate WS_CLIPCHILDREN;
SWP_FRAMECHANGED is required.
---
