From 3cac3d671118aa443ce4701e8cd9364f6d4f578d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: d-b-c-e <anthony.mason1@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 21:42:26 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 14/15] winhybrid: DIJoystick2 primary format - 128-button
 support in the default provider

The DIJOYSTATE2 base patch updated only the pure dinput module's enum
callback, but Windows MAME defaults to winhybrid, which still passed
c_dfDIJoystick (32-button cap) with no fallback. Racing wheels stayed
capped at 32 buttons everywhere it mattered: the Moza R12 reports 128
buttons ("128 buttons reported, DIJoystick (32-button legacy) format
accepted" per the new verbose diagnostic in dinput_joystick_device).

With DIJoystick2 accepted, buttons 33-48 exist as ITEM_ID_ADD_SWITCH1-16
(standard tokens ADDSW1-16; 49+ collapse into OTHER_SWITCH). External
tools tokenize them BUTTONnn, which never parses - the launcher-side ctrlr
translator maps BUTTON33-48 -> ADDSW1-16.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01M8n8qHsRWCKsJjXgqH6e98
---
 src/osd/modules/input/input_dinput.cpp    | 5 +++++
 src/osd/modules/input/input_winhybrid.cpp | 7 ++++++-
 2 files changed, 11 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/osd/modules/input/input_dinput.cpp b/src/osd/modules/input/input_dinput.cpp
index d7aa31ca..8c6ce2b0 100644
--- a/src/osd/modules/input/input_dinput.cpp
+++ b/src/osd/modules/input/input_dinput.cpp
@@ -557,6 +557,11 @@ dinput_joystick_device::dinput_joystick_device(
 	dinput_device(std::move(name), std::move(id), module, std::move(device), caps, format),
 	m_joystick({ { 0 } })
 {
+	osd_printf_verbose(
+			"DirectInput joystick: %u buttons reported, %s format accepted\n",
+			unsigned(m_caps.dwButtons),
+			(m_format == &c_dfDIJoystick) ? "DIJoystick (32-button legacy)" : "DIJoystick2 (128-button)");
+
 	// cap the number of axes, POVs, and buttons based on the format
 	m_caps.dwAxes = std::min(m_caps.dwAxes, DWORD(8));
 	m_caps.dwPOVs = std::min(m_caps.dwPOVs, DWORD(4));
diff --git a/src/osd/modules/input/input_winhybrid.cpp b/src/osd/modules/input/input_winhybrid.cpp
index d6f33d2d..856fb333 100644
--- a/src/osd/modules/input/input_winhybrid.cpp
